# Raw renders are 8-9MB PNGs each (233MB in all). Every one is listed in
# README.md with its Higgsfield job or kie.ai task id, and the contact sheets
# (render/contact-*.jpg) are the reviewable copy. They stay on disk in iCloud.
render/*.png
# Shoe-cleanup experiment Evan turned down, and its mask. Only the chosen base
# is needed to rebuild the photo with place_v3.py.
base/*.png
!base/spec-v3-base.png
# The final PNG is rebuilt by place_v3.py in seconds; the q95 JPEG is tracked.
web/*.png
art/_warped_*.png
